# Germaine Training Institute — repository .gitignore
# Root of the repo = this "update" project folder (build10/ + germaine-backend/).
# Nothing listed here is deleted from disk — this only controls what git tracks.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / environment files — never commit real credentials.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Python virtual environments (two exist in this project: the active
# germaine-backend/.venv and the legacy build10/EarnCash/backend/venv).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Python bytecode / caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Local databases / dumps / schema exports — never commit real or
# even sample data files, and never commit raw SQL dumps.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.sql
*backup*/
*.bak

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / frontend tooling (none currently used, kept for safety)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Sandbox/FUSE-mount artifacts (created by this cloud dev environment
# while files were open during editing — not real project files).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.fuse_hidden*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Out-of-project clutter present in this mounted folder — not part of
# the GTI application. Confirmed during the Phase 16 audit:
#   imagesss/  — raw, unprocessed source-photo staging area (several
#                multi-gigabyte Google Drive zip exports, the largest
#                over 1.3GB — nowhere near GitHub's 100MB/file limit
#                and not referenced by any deployed page)
#   gitignore/ — stray leftover folder (contains only an empty .venv)
#   New folder/ — empty stray folder
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
imagesss/
gitignore/
New folder/
